    "category": "error_taxonomy",
    "protocol_version": "1.0",
    "description": "CONTRACT_SPEC.md §7.2 + §15.3 + §14.3: an X-Cephios-API-Version header with a major mismatch against the cloud's supported version returns 426 VersionError 'api_version_unsupported'.",
